# Paths where, if the three-way merge between the CachyOS base and the Fedora tree
# conflicts, the Fedora tree wins: the Red Hat patch carries the same backport in a
# different variant and Fedora is what gets tested and shipped. Any conflict outside
# this list stops the build. Bash patterns ([[ == ]]), one per line.
MAINTAINERS
drivers/media/platform/amd/isp4/*
